# Redis writes its snapshot into the working directory, and running the suite
# against a local server is what CLAUDE.md's gates ask for — so this appears in
# the repository root for anybody who follows them.
dump.rdb

# Hypothesis's example database: the inputs that previously failed a
# property-based test, replayed first on the next run so a bug found once stays
# found. It is a cache of this machine's search, not a shared artifact — the
# `ci` profile disables it outright — and the suite is correct without it.
.hypothesis/

# mutmut copies the whole project here, mutates the copy, and keeps its cache,
# its per-file `.meta` results and its exported stats alongside. Nothing in it
# is source — deleting it just forces the next `mutmut run` to be a full one.
mutants/

# macOS
.DS_Store
